Rebuilt Node, Directory, and File class constructors;
Built the program skeleton with loops and initial values;
Reordered 6 methods to fit inside Commands.cs;
Refactored Touch, CP, and CP-r methods to use the new constructors;
Fixed some variable declarations in Touch;
Format all three codes to match C# syntax spacing.

Please review it to get in touch with the latest changes and understand the logic.
Ask me whenever you didn't get the logic I wrote. :)

